{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_st01",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_st01",
  "title": "逆行",
  "storyCode": "DV-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "14eca4792ade03feafdb8e766f260db86c302fb66e0ff0b3687daaf6be959883",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "您好，這裡是萊茵生命總轄克麗斯騰·萊特的私人辦公室。\n萊特女士目前不方便接聽您的電話，請在聽到提示音後留言，謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "糟糕，克麗斯騰，我好像搞砸了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那個上校的確不是傻瓜，上次交貨的時候，他發現了我的那些“小伎倆”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他和斐爾迪南的人一直盯著我，我浪費了好幾個分身才逃到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "萊茵那邊，斐爾迪南也肯定很快就會有行動......而其他幾科的主任要嘛聽他的，要嘛只會裝傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，搞不好我真的逃不掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我有一點害怕。雖然只有一點點......但很難得不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不過，我們之間的約定，我還是會好好遵守哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......克麗斯騰，我忍不住想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "答錄機",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要是她還在的話，我們是不是就不會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "繆爾賽思女士，我建議你不要再掙扎了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "你從萊茵總部跑到商業區，浪費了我們整整一個晚上的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "我再怎麼跑都沒有用，是吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "只要我還在特里蒙城內，你們就總有辦法追上來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "不，不僅在特里蒙，換作其他城市也沒有區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "這裡是哥倫比亞。一個人只要犯了法，就不該奢望能躲過裁決。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......你是指，我違反了與軍方簽訂的保密條款？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "那麼你該給我一些時間，讓我聯繫下我的律師——而不是派那麼多全副武裝的雇傭兵，滿大街對我窮追不捨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "我說過了，這裡是哥倫比亞啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "所有明面上的流程只在需要它生效的時候生效，至於其他場合，我們更偏好效率。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "好吧。我能再跟斐爾迪南談談嗎？我和他或許還來得及解開誤會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "不行哦，我接到的命令可並不包含這一環。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "你......你不是斐爾迪南雇來的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "斐爾迪南·克魯尼與你共事，與我卻只是暫時的合作夥伴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "我對萊茵內部的爭鬥並不感興趣。生態科也好，能量科也好，我和我的雇主並不介意合作的對象具體是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "我們要的是成果。萊茵生命提供產品，我的雇主會考慮如何使用它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "而你之前犯下的那個小小的錯誤，讓你徹底失去了我們的信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......如果我說，我不是故意的，你會相信嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "隨手保存一些實驗資料，只是我身為科研人員的習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "習慣？這就是你考慮半天才準備好的說辭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "很遺憾，你的特殊魅力對我並不起作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "我相信斐爾迪南提醒過你，在相關法案被政府通過之前，整個實驗內容都不能有一丁點洩露。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "精靈的血脈延長了你的美貌保質期，也確保了你不會得上習慣性健忘，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "你知道我是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "......精靈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "掌握合作對象的檔案內容是我的義務之一哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "所以，也請你配合一點，放棄製造下一個同樣起不了作用的幻象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "看來我真的無路可走了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "這就是你拖延時間的原因吧......還以為能騙過我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "我可不是什麼只會使用蠻力的愣頭青，又或者你那些在實驗室待久了的同僚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "抓到你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "這溫度......水分子......聽不到我的呼喚了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "這是你的源石技藝......還是某種特別的技術？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "你還有閒心與我研討學術問題嗎，繆爾賽思“主任”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "可惜我厭倦了捉迷藏，也不想讓突然出現的冰水弄濕我的羽毛和頭髮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "哈哈......你......不是普通的雇傭兵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "多謝誇獎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "現在，你還有最後一個機會——回答我的提問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "克麗斯騰·萊特，萊茵生命的總轄，她連續幾年從各個公司手中採購了大量硬提純物，究竟是在做什麼實驗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "呼......哈......既然你和你背後的人關心總轄的實驗，為什麼還要幫斐爾迪南？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "回答錯誤。我需要的是答案，而非另一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "我沒有......任何......你想要的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "從你的檔案來看，你很喜歡利用血脈賦予你的能力耍弄別人。我真沒想到你會對總轄這麼忠誠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "忠誠......嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "我只是......為了我......自己......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "唔......看來你並不想抓住這機會呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "那麼，繆爾賽思女士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "我們之間的合作就此終止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "終止......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "塞雷婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "繆爾賽思",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "克麗斯騰那邊......希望你還來得及呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2:43 A.M. 天氣/陰\n特里蒙主城區"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特里蒙市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "女士，您在等的人還沒到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "她十分鐘前就該到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "我從沒指望過她會守時，但從上一則通訊的情況來看，對於這次會面，她比我更著急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特里蒙市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "她會不會又反悔了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特里蒙市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "我們都知道，萊茵生命的生態科主任總是笑盈盈的，卻從來不愛說真話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "我不信任繆爾賽思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "我不會輕易信任任何至今仍留在萊茵生命的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "可信任並非達成合作的唯一前提。當初我找到你的時候，你難道就信任我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特里蒙市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "咳咳......要我說實話嗎，女士？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特里蒙市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "當時看到你站在我家門前，我差點就想躲進廚房，拿上點什麼東西防身，再順帶報個警。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "明智的做法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "然而，萊茵生命不至於動用武力威脅一名簽署了保密協定的離職員工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "......至少我還在防衛科的時候不至於。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "新訊息？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特里蒙市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "女士，怎麼了？你的表情好、好嚴肅......嚴肅到我忍不住打了個寒顫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "情況有變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "繆爾賽思不會來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特里蒙市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "她......她出事了？就在她要來找你的節骨眼上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "艾瑞克森，我需要你幫我做一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特里蒙市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "什、什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "把我收到的消息送到一家醫藥公司的辦事處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "請幹員們立刻告知凱爾希醫生與Dr.{@nickname}——我知道他們最近就在哥倫比亞境內。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞雷婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "我需要他們的幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5:11 A.M. 天氣/陰\n特里蒙城外，359號實驗基地"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
      "text": "早上好啊，博士。您起得總是這麼早。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "規律的作息有助於中樞數據的穩定。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "數、數據？您是說生理數據吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "哈哈，您說起話來總有一股特別的幽默感。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "呼......熬了一整夜才跑出這麼點數據，弗蘭克斯主任一定會責備我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "否定，描述與多蘿西·弗蘭克斯的慣常表現不符。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "呃，您是在安慰我嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "多謝......可就算弗蘭克斯主任不計較，我也不敢回去見斐爾迪南主任......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你真的該好好睡一覺了，海倫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "埃琳娜......只要一想到一周之後的考核，我就完全睡不著。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "我真的很需要這份工作，我的助學貸款還沒還完......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "......對不起，我不該總是在你們面前念叨這些。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "嗯......這樣好不好？等實驗結束以後，我去找主任聊聊你的事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "真、真的嗎？埃琳娜......整個能量科就只有你不怕斐爾迪南主任，你是怎麼做到的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "要是你像我一樣......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "一個月在實驗室裡待三十天，什麼事都做到讓主任滿意？我、我可不行......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "萊茵實驗員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "對了，我該去見弗蘭克斯主任了，回頭見！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "回頭見。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "我剛煮的咖啡，你也來一杯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "攝入過量咖啡因可能會加重礦石病，埃琳娜小姐。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你說得對，但我還不想為了一種可能性而放棄我的生活。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "要是什麼都聽醫生的，那我現在最好和姐姐一起留在羅德島。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你不也是嗎，喬伊絲？醫療部的幹員們都希望你長期留艦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "按照規定，我需要定期回萊茵生命述職。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "來到這個基地提供醫療服務，只是臨時任務。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "嗯......再過兩三天，你就會回城與赫默醫生會合吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "我和多蘿西會想你的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "喬伊絲需要休息，基地的工作強度太大了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "還有你，埃琳娜，要不是斐爾迪南百般強調你是他手下最優秀的研究員，我也想狠狠心，把你趕回城去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "多蘿西，你總算露面了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "海倫剛剛去找你了，你沒遇見她嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "抱歉，沒注意......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你呀，是不是忙到頭暈眼花啦？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "先別說我和喬伊絲，你究竟幾天沒闔眼了？過去一周，你實驗室的垃圾桶裡裝滿了提神試劑的包裝盒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "......實驗已經進入最終階段。我答應過受試者，會加快實驗進度，這樣他們就能和家人們儘早團聚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "好吧，沒人不希望實驗快點完成。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "更何況，作為你的助手，我只能聽你的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "那麼——我能請親愛的助手再多幫一個忙嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我沒法離開實驗室太久，我想請你幫我把這些發熱模組送給外面的朋友們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "發熱模組？我們在荒野上待了一個多月了，你從哪買到的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "警告，檢測到萊茵生命技術元件。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你看，喬伊絲和我一眼就能看出來，這是你用實驗室材料改裝的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "商務科的老古板們可不會太高興。就算你是源石技藝應用科的主任，他們的嘮叨也一點不會變少。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我很清楚他們會怎麼想。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我更清楚，你不會把這件小事報告給斐爾迪南或者其他主任的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "他們需要這些小東西。最近天氣轉冷，臨時搭建的小屋很難抵禦寒風。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......多蘿西。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "我一直想說......你是不是太關心他們了啊？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "他們......是拓荒隊成員，萊茵生命雇傭的拓荒隊成員。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "拓荒隊成員不會在任何一個地方停留，更不會把我們當作朋友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "他們只是一群普通的年輕人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "而且，我明白你的意思。你是在擔心我，你生怕等他們走了以後我會感到失落。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "我的小助手總是這麼體貼呀......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......別這樣笑瞇瞇地看著我。我可不是你的學生，弗蘭克斯主任。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "多蘿西",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "埃琳娜......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "好吧，我就再幫你一次，最後一次。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "反正......實驗就快結束了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "領隊，我們都準備好了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "領隊......桑尼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "嗯？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "你是不是很緊張？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "緊張？不，我怎麼會緊張。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "......你繞著屋子走了七圈了。現在是第八圈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "我只是......我在整理思緒。接下來的事情變數會很多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "桑尼，我在想，我們真的該這麼做嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "那幾個科學家，還有那個醫生，她們對我們還挺好的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......我早就告訴過你們，一次兩次善意之舉根本說明不了什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "當我還在法學院念書的時候，我的那些同學很喜歡舉辦慈善活動——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "給感染者收治區捐點東西，或者在校園辯論中為他們的遭遇打抱不平。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "但是，在我成了那個不幸得病的倒楣蛋以後，你猜他們來看過我幾次？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "幾次？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "一次都沒有。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "一年前，我去找大學室友借錢，那時他已經是特區最大律所的雇員。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "接起電話以後，他竟然問我我是誰。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "“抱歉，你休學治病去了，所以畢業手冊上沒有登記你的聯繫方式。”——哈！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "真是我聽過的最動人的笑話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "真是一幫混蛋，不是嗎？這樣的混蛋，我們每個人都見得多啦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "當處在安全距離的時候，播撒一點善心會成為他們自我滿足的方式，也能成為他們茶餘飯後的談資。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你猜猜看......此時此刻，那邊的實驗室裡，那些體面的科學家，是不是正端著咖啡杯談論著我們？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "在真正觸及自身利益之前，所有人都不介意展露自己的好心腸。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "好吧，頭兒，你說了算。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "你見得最多，想得也最多。你總是對的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......我們必須這樣做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "在這個基地，沒有人會真正為我們考慮，除了我們自己。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "來吧，喬伊絲，等我喝完這杯咖啡，我們就該去工作了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "醫生......醫生！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......拓荒隊的人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你們不該隨便進來......呃，還沒經過消毒程序......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "醫生在哪裡？老薩姆他、他突然發病了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "發病......礦石病？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "醫生，你是醫生嗎？救命，救救老薩姆，救救我們！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "從昨天半夜開始，他身上就燙得嚇人，剛剛已經開始咳血了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "請明確病人位置。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "就在最近的屋子裡......我們照你們之前教的方法，給他餵了點止痛劑，讓他半躺著。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "瞭解。立刻啟動緊急醫療程式。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......喬伊絲！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "抱歉，其餘事務優先順序需要下調。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "我......我明白。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "我不是想阻止你，雖然這趟出診並不符合安全規範......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "喬伊絲，我和你一起去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你並非醫務工作者，埃琳娜小姐。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "管不了那麼多了。別忘了，我也接受過基礎醫療工作的培訓。情況緊急，多一雙手幫忙總是更好的吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "再加上多蘿西的囑託，我總得去一趟的。就是現在了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "我們到了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "病人在哪裡？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "別擋著我們，礦石病急性發作耽誤不得！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你們......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "掃描結果為空。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "拓荒隊成員",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "別亂動！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "這是......射釘槍？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "附近沒有礦石病急性發作者。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "是的，喬伊絲，他們看起來身體狀況都還不錯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "要不然，他們不會有力氣舉著危險工具對準我們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "舉起手來，女士們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "你是......拓荒隊的領隊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你還記得我，這多少讓我有一些意外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "領隊先生，你把我和喬伊絲騙到這裡來，是為了什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你會知道的，烏比卡......博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "你的姓是這麼念嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "埃琳娜",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "發音還挺標準的......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "麻煩你把通訊器借我們用一下，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "桑尼",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "拓荒隊需要向你的上級提幾個問題。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
